{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "genji-modern",
  "chunk_id": "genji-modern-chunk-3152",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03152",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "想必是夕雾长年相思的报应吧：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It must have been the recompense for Yugiri's many years of longing:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03152",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "内大臣从前那种强硬态度，今已影迹全无，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "the Minister of the Interior's former harsh attitude had now vanished without a trace,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03152",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "他变得很柔弱了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and he had become quite gentle and yielding.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03152",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "他想找个良好机会，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He wanted to find a good opportunity,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03152",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "不是有意做作的，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "one that would not seem deliberately contrived,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03152",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "却又适于迎接新婿的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "yet would still be fitting for welcoming his new son-in-law.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03152",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "时值四月上旬，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It was early in the fourth month,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03152",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "庭中藤花盛开，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and the wisteria in the garden was in full bloom,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03152",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "景色之美，迥异寻常。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "making the scene extraordinarily beautiful, quite unlike ordinary days.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03152",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "坐视其空过盛期，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "To sit by and let its finest season pass in vain",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03152",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "岂不可惜。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "would surely have been a pity.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03152",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "于是举行管弦之会。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "So he held a gathering for music.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03152",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "夕阳渐渐西沉，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "As the evening sun gradually sank westward,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03152",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "花色更增艳丽。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "the colors of the flowers grew still more splendid.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03152",
      "unit_index": 15,
      "source_text": "内大臣便命柏木送信与夕雾，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The Minister of the Interior then ordered Kashiwagi to take a letter to Yugiri,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03152",
      "unit_index": 16,
      "source_text": "并叫他口头传言：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and also told him to convey this message by word of mouth:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03152",
      "unit_index": 17,
      "source_text": "“前日花阴晤谈，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The other day, when we met and talked beneath the blossoms,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03152",
      "unit_index": 18,
      "source_text": "未得罄述衷曲。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I was unable to tell you all that was in my heart.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03152",
      "unit_index": 19,
      "source_text": "今日倘有余暇，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If you have any leisure today,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03152",
      "unit_index": 20,
      "source_text": "极盼即刻光临。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I most earnestly hope you will come at once.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p03152",
      "unit_index": 21,
      "source_text": "信中有诗一首：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The letter contained one poem:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
